// Conformance fixture for MMA/truncate.py (TRUNCATE directive).
// Exercises the default side, Side=Right, a numeric side, Count, and
// fractional beat lengths.
Time 4
TimeSig 4 4
Tempo 100
KeySig C
RndSeed 1
Groove SWING

// plain 4/4 reference bar
C

// 1 beat, pattern taken from the start (default side)
Truncate 1
C

// 2 beats, pattern taken from the right side
Truncate 2 Side=Right
C

// numeric side: start at beat 3 of the pattern
Truncate 1 Side=3
C

// Count=2: the next two bars are 2 beats
Truncate 2 Count=2
C
C

// fractional beats
Truncate 1.5
G

// fractional side: last 1.5 beats of the 4/4 pattern
Truncate 1.5 Side=3.5
G

// back to normal
C
